## Architecture Summary

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                       ErrorBoundary                         │
│                                                             │
│  getDerivedStateFromError()  ──►  set hasError + details    │
│         (sync, during render)                               │
│                                                             │
│  componentDidCatch()         ──►  enrich details            │
│         (after render)            logError()                │
│                                   props.onError()           │
│                                                             │
│  componentDidUpdate()        ──►  auto-reset on resetKeys   │
│                                                             │
│  retry()                     ──►  clear state → re-render   │
│                                                             │
│  render()                                                   │
│    ├─ hasError → fallback prop ─OR─ <DefaultFallback />     │
│    └─ no error → children                                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

| Feature | Where |
|---|---|
| Catches render errors | `getDerivedStateFromError` + `componentDidCatch` |
| Styled fallback UI | `DefaultFallback` component |
| Retry button | `retry()` method resets state |
| Error logging | `logError()` with grouped console output |
| External reporter | `onError` prop |
| Auto-reset | `componentDidUpdate` watching `resetKeys` |
| Custom fallback | `fallback` render-prop |
| Copy to clipboard | Async clipboard API inside fallback |
